{
  "about": "Field classes of the people domain's types for the house ledger (VERIFY_HARDENING 6.3, lint L-WATCH part 2; WP-D people). 'fields' classifies a field name on every type of house_sim/data/types/people.json (it wins over the kernel's name classes of house_sim/data/verify/watch_fields.json for these types); 'types' refines one type's fields; 'water_sensitive' lists the types house.wet judges (paper, the hearing aid, mains and battery electronics, a sleep space). Classes: placement, setting, condition (worse: true / false / up / down / change, tol), identity, content, process, bookkeeping. Every property of every people type is classified (tests/test_people_hardening.py WatchCensusTests; tools/field_census.py --unclassified --domain people lists none). Notes: a mobility aid's folded / seat / size_m follow its settings.folded (the set verb writes all three: settings.folded is the watched setting, the rest follow it); doses_left falls when a patient takes a dose from a bottle handed over (the person's own act, written as volition) and is content otherwise; in_use_by / offered / hidden_by / last_used_* are people's bookkeeping of who holds or uses a thing.",
